      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Melekisedeke eu, mukelenge wa Salema, muakuidi wa Nzambi Mutambe Bunene wa mu diulu, wakasangakana ne Abalahama hakadiye uhingana ku kushiha kuandi kua bakelenge, ne wakamusankisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudiye kabidi, Abalahama wakabanyangana nʼandi tshia dikumi tshia bintu bionso (diambedi muikale mukudimuna dina ne, Mukelenge wa buakane; hashishe kabidi, udi biandi Mukelenge wa Salema, kuamba ne, Mukelenge wa ditalala; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kai tatu, kai mamu, kai bankambua, kai tshibangidilu tshia matuku anyi nshikidilu wa muoyo, kadi muvuishibue bu Muana wa Nzambi) udi muikale muakuidi tshiendelele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuelangane meshi bu muakadi bunene bua muntu eu, wakadi Abalahama, nkambua wetu, muhe tshia dikumi tshia mu bintu bitambe buimpe biakanyengeye mu nvita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bobo mene ba ku bana ba Lewi badi bangata mudimu wa muakuidi badi ne mukenshi wa kuangatabo bia dikumi kudi bantu bu mudi mikenshi nuambe, kudi bana babo mene, nasha bobo bine bafume ku tshimono tshia Abalahama; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi yeye udi kai ne bankambua bandi babadibua kudi Bena Lewi, wakangata tshia dikumi tshia bintu kudi Abalahama, ne wakasankisha udi ne milayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi kakuena mpata bua udi utamba bukese udi usankishibua kudi udi umutamba bunene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunoko badi bafua badi bangata bia dikumi, kadi kuakua umue udi ubiangata udibo batuambila ne, Utshidi ne muoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne, bua kuamba nunku, Lewi mene udi wangata bia dikumi, wakabifila mu difila dia Abalahama; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bualu bua wakatshidi mu tshimono tshia tatu wandi, hakamusangana Melekisedeke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, bu buakane bujalame buikaleku bua buakuidi bua Bena Lewi (bua munshi muabu bantu bakuangata mikenshi) munyi muakadibo kukengela bua muakuidi mukuabo abike wa ku mulongo wa Melekisedeke, ne kabadibu wa ku mulongo wa Alona? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bakakudimuka buakuidi, buakadiku mbua kukudimuna mikenshi kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua yeye muena malu â adibo bamba, udi muena tshisamba tshikuabo, kuditshi kakuakadi muntu wakukuata mudimu wa ku tshioshelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu budi bumanyishibua ne, Mukelenge wetu wakuledibua mu tshisamba tshia Yuda, tshisamba tshivua Mose kai muambile bua bakuidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne budi butamba kumanyishibua ne, Bikala munga muakuidi ubika mufuanangane ne Melekisedeke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakavuishabo muakuidi, kembua mikenshi ya bantu ba ha buloba, kadi bua bukole bua muoyo udi kawi ujimina; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bualu bua badi bamba ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua muakuidi munene wa nunku wakadi mutukumbane, wa tshijila, kai ne bubi, kai mubiha, mutahuluke kudi bantu babi, muvuishibue ha mutu ha mulu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "udi kai ne bualu, bu muakadi nʼabu bakuidi banene aba, bua kufila milambu ku dituku ne ku dituku, diambedi bua mibi yandi yeye, hashishe bua mibi ya bantu; bua yeye wakenza bualu ebu musangu umue tshiendelele hakadifileye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua mikenshi idi iteka bantu mu buakuidi bunene, bobo bikale ne butekete; kadi dî dia kuditshiha, diakadi ku nyima kua mikenshi, didi diteka Muana, udi mufuishibue muakane mujalame tshiendelele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
